Wait, maybe I need to visualize it. Let's think of the sheet as a grid. Let me think of the sheet as 22 columns (units) and 15 rows (units). If I want to place 3x5 rectangles, then in the direction of the columns, they can be placed either 3 units wide or 5 units wide. Similarly, in the rows, they can be placed 5 units tall or 3 units tall.

